# Recipe for script/gather/skinning-enhanced.razor. Build it with: python3 util/build-scripts.py
# The blocks are module/<folder>/<name>.razor files, run in the order listed under #@ blocks.
# module/base.razor comes first in every loop without a #@ use line.
#@ output script/gather/skinning-enhanced.razor

#@ header
# Dungeon Two-Handed Axe melee with Magery self support, combat potions, sword codex control and corpse skinning.
# Needs: a Two-Handed Axe, a skinning knife, codices of swords and parrying, bandages, potions and reagents.
# Optional: the loadout looting pouch.
# Template: Forensic Evaluation 120, Swordsmanship 100, Tactics 100, Magery, Resisting Spells, Parrying, Anatomy, Healing 80.
# Optional cooldown bars: heal pot, walk, reflect. A missing bar reads 0 and cannot hold a cast back.
# Melee stays manual (Z then V). The script never attacks and never picks a target.
# Magery is for recovery and PK readiness: Smart Heal/Cure, Greater Heal, Reactive Armor and Magic Reflection.
# Warmode is toggled by hand (Tab). Recovery, buffs and skinning ignore it. Meet a PK with combat/pvp (F4).
# The knife is used from the backpack, so the axe stays equipped. Leather is looted by hand from the opened corpse.
# Design notes and in-game checks: blueprint/open-items.html part 11.

#@ blocks
# Every pass, in this order.
#@ use fight/target            remembers the enemy picked with lasttarget
#@ use recovery/pouch          trapped pouch while held
#@ use recovery/cure           cure potion, else the Cure agent
#@ use recovery/heal           heal potion, else Greater Heal at the emergency line
#@ use recovery/bandage        self bandage
#@ use recovery/light-heal     light Heal, the bandage stand-in
#@ use recovery/refresh        Refresh at low stamina
#@ use fight/axe               re-arms the Two-Handed Axe
#@ use pack/gold-drop          drops gold while over weight
#@ use buff/potions            Strength, Agility and Magic Resist while an enemy is remembered
#@ use fight/sword-codex       Warrior, Defensive while hurt, and the finisher
#@ use fight/parry-codex       Bulwark, Warding against damage over time, and the finisher
#@ use fight/weapon-ability    Chop on the enemy within 2 tiles
#@ use buff/spells             Reactive Armor, then Magic Reflection
#@ use gather/skinning         carves corpses between fights
#@ use recovery/reagents       reagent flags, read after the carve replies so it cannot consume them
#@ use buff/food               eats from a tray
#@ use pack/leather            moves leather into the loot pouch

#@ config
#| Only the settings this loop changes. Every other setting keeps the default in its module.
#| Put the reason in "#" lines right above the value. util/build-scripts.py writes the "#|" lines.
#| Every setting of this loop: python3 util/build-scripts.py --settings recipe/skinning-enhanced-recipe.razor

#| ---- module/recovery/heal.razor -------------------------------------------------------
#| Missing hit points that cast Greater Heal when no heal potion went out on this pass.
#| Not below heal_hits.
#| Default 35. Read by recovery/heal.
# Bandages handle ordinary damage, so Greater Heal waits for 45.
@setvar! config__emergency_hits 45

#| ---- module/recovery/bandage.razor ----------------------------------------------------
#| Healing must be above this to bandage. At or below it recovery/light-heal stands in.
#| Default 0. Read by recovery/bandage, recovery/light-heal.
# Healing 80 template. Below 10 the light Heal stands in.
@setvar! config__heal_skill_min 10

#| ---- module/recovery/refresh.razor ----------------------------------------------------
#| Current stamina at or below this drinks a Refresh.
#| Default 15. Read by recovery/refresh.
# DEX 80 gives about 80 stamina. Refresh at 60.
@setvar! config__refresh_stam 60

#| ---- module/buff/potions.razor --------------------------------------------------------
#| STR with the Greater Strength potion on: your base plus 20. Below it the potion is drunk, and
#| 0 turns it off. Bless and the Strength spell, ours or an ally's, show the same icon as the
#| potion but add less than its 20, so the stat tells them apart.
#| Default 120. Read by buff/potions.
# STR 100 and DEX 80 template.
@setvar! config__str_potion 120

#| ---- module/buff/spells.razor ---------------------------------------------------------
#| Minimum current mana to start Reactive Armor.
#| Default 4. Read by buff/spells.
# Buffs keep the lumberjack handbook's 20 mana for Greater Heal and Teleport against a PK.
@setvar! config__mana_reactive_armor 24

#| Minimum current mana to start Magic Reflection.
#| Default 14. Read by buff/spells.
# Same reserve: the base 14 plus the handbook's 20.
@setvar! config__mana_magic_reflect 34

#| 1 buffs while poisoned. 0 holds them back and cuts one that is casting, so the cure goes first.
#| Default 1. Read by buff/spells.
# The cure goes first: no buffs while poisoned.
@setvar! config__buff_when_poisoned 0

#@ setup
# pack/leather moves leather into this pouch. restock/loadout picks it, this asks when it is missing.
if not varexist global__my_looting_pouch or not find global__my_looting_pouch backpack
    overhead "[ loot pouch, pick ]" 255
    setvar global__my_looting_pouch
endif

# loot/recycle runs the hotkey named in this list when it finishes or gives up. A list, because
# a variable cannot hold a word (blueprint/razor.html part 3). It lasts until the client closes.
if not listexists 'list__resume_script'
    createlist 'list__resume_script'
endif
clearlist 'list__resume_script'
pushlist 'list__resume_script' 'Play Script: gather\skinning-enhanced'

if config__sysmsg = 1
    sysmsg "Skinning enhanced v11 loaded: skin unowned={{config__skin_unowned}}, sword stance={{config__sword_stance_main}}, parry stance={{config__parry_stance_main}}." 88
endif
if config__chatty = 1
    overhead "[ skinning, on ]" 290
endif
